---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | PhotoEditingPrompt" desc="How PhotoEditingPrompt handles data: no accounts, no photo uploads, and what is stored in your browser.">
  <div class="narrow">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › Privacy Policy</nav>
    <h1 class="page-title" style="font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,44px);margin:28px 0 20px">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Last updated: 22 November 2026.</p>
      <p>This policy explains what {SITE.name} ({SITE.domain}) does and does not do with your information. The site is run from India.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>{SITE.name} has no accounts, no sign-up and no forms. We do not ask for your name, email address, phone number or photos. Photos are uploaded by you directly to ChatGPT or Gemini and never pass through this site.</p>
      <h2>What is stored in your browser</h2>
      <p>Three small settings are saved only in your own browser, on your own device, and are never sent to us: your light or dark theme choice, the prompts you save with the heart button (your "Saved" list), and your language choice. You can clear them at any time by clearing this site's data in your browser settings.</p>
      <h2>Hosting and logs</h2>
      <p>Our hosting provider (Cloudflare) may keep standard server logs, such as IP address, browser type and the pages requested, for security and reliability. We do not use these logs to identify individual visitors.</p>
      <h2>Analytics, cookies and advertising</h2>
      <p>This site does not currently use analytics, advertising or tracking cookies. If that changes, this page will be updated first to name the services used and the cookies they set.</p>
      <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
      <p>Prompt pages link to ChatGPT, Gemini and Pinterest. When you follow those links, the other company's own privacy policy applies. We do not control what they collect.</p>
      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This site is meant for a general audience and does not knowingly collect information from anyone, including children.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Because we do not collect personal data, there is normally nothing to access, correct or delete. If you believe we hold information about you, contact us and we will look into it.</p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy. The date at the top shows the latest version.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: <a class="link" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
